## Customer

The party record every commercial document links to. Consumes base fields only: `EmailField`, `PhoneNumberField` (E.164 string), `AddressField`.

```ts
import { Customer } from '../customer';
@field customer = linksTo(Customer);
```

Linked from Invoice, Order, and Subscription.

**Non-goals:** person/company split, multiple contacts per account, customer lifecycle status — those belong to the CRM records (Lead/Opportunity/Deal), not the billing party.
